# Compatibility Page TSconfig of the former ProfileEditing content element.
#
# Delivered by the set "fgtclb/academic-persons-edit-profile-editing" and
# registered for the page field "Page TSconfig" by
# "Configuration/TCA/Overrides/pages.php" - one physical copy, two ways to it.
#
# Existing page records and site sets may still refer to this path, so the file
# remains resolvable. It deliberately changes no backend configuration: the
# legacy CType stays hidden and InlineProfile is enabled only by its own
# component or by the aggregate configuration.
